cayed corridors, discover disturbing documents and drawings, and slowly piece together the story . Every step brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and to madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because within these walls, the past is not just a memory\u2026 it is waiting for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8ad6ebee1bf24d5066d1b242fbb7dc45.webp?t=1759942171\" data-has-big width=1560 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive and realistic atmosphere</strong> powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dark, story-rich narrative</strong>, revealed through letters, documents, and the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and light puzzles</strong> to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying and unsettling scenes</strong>, focused on psychological horror rather than gore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.poster.avif?t=1759942171\" width=780 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.webm?t=1759942171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/extras/8b4f714a7b2dd39d53cee12d41c12c59.mp4?t=1759942171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Silent Walls: Subject 13</strong> is an independent, family-driven project developed in <strong>France</strong>. More than just a game, it\u2019s the realization of a childhood dream. Thank you to everyone supporting <strong>indie horror</strong>.</p>","developers":["Hollow Signal Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981010/730f48dd4b9770d03846328acac5b53ef65ff98e/header.jpg?t=1759942171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981010/703939020/92ab468aafb95579b98a556c96319698eb72f68e/1755937808/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756878075","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981010/703939020/92ab468aafb95579b98a556c96319698eb72f68e/1755937808/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756878075","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981010/703939020/92ab468aafb95579b98a556c96319698eb72f68e/1755937808/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756878075","id":257187556,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187556/movie480.mp4?t=1756878075","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187556/movie_max.mp4?t=1756878075"},"name":"In Silent Walls : Sujet 13 (FR)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187556/609a99c750c79007ec891cc23b3163ae0f687ae1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756878075","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187556/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756878075","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187556/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756878075"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981010/244749407/eb78807728079a92da0b2637810bf821d57ec1ee/1